      "fields": [
        "topic",
        "severity"
      ],
      "text": "Spotify includes lots of free and very good music. Unfortunately, the not-premium version includes much advertisements and cannot be played in the background. Yet, Spotify is useful for listening music without using too much Mobile Data.",
