    {
      "review_id": "5da7e835-fea0-447f-ba6a-d8729ef9a022",
      "fields": [
        "topic",
        "severity"
      ],
      "text": "I started using this app this not one holl month ago and it went from great to absolutely disgraceful for one whenever I try to play one of my liked songs it only plays about 10 seconds of it on repeat and whenever I try to select a song sometimes it plays a song I never heard of before and secondly whenever I try to look through an album for one song, I can't I just have to press the play button ",
