      }
    },
    {
      "review_id": "8aff78ef-2aaf-44e7-af77-077e456cc367",
      "fields": [
        "topic"
      ],
      "text": "I click on a song, and it plays a different song from the same artist. The name on the main page is the same, but the name on the scrolldown screen is different. I did some research, and what I can see is that this glitch is only affecting accounts that are free. The fact that this app is considered the best music app of our time is beyond me.",
